# "Counter target instant or sorcery spell": one of the Wanderer controller's own spells is a legal target (the other side's
# is taken in the neighbouring scenarios). Bot1 casts Brainstorm, sacrifices its Wanderer to it, and (the default) does not
# pay {1} though an Island is untapped, so Brainstorm is countered and nothing is drawn.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Mausoleum Wanderer
Island
Brainstorm
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x15

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Mausoleum Wanderer.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Island#2.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Brainstorm.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mausoleum Wanderer.Activate(Stack.Brainstorm)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard = Brainstorm; Mausoleum Wanderer
Bot1.Hand.Count = 4
